# dreamos Openbox session autostart - OpusDM desktop shell.
#
# opusdm-hub is the desktop: a full-screen keep-below window that draws
# the background and desktop icons, plus its own toolbar. It also finds
# opusdm-lister next to itself (/usr/bin) and opens the first Lister
# window on $HOME. No separate panel or wallpaper setter is needed.
opusdm-hub &
